{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ADHD Nook 是一款專為神經多樣性人士設計的極簡工具選擇器，幫助使用者在需要專注、恢復精力或調節情緒時，輕鬆找到合適的活動。這款 App 現正限時免費提供，原本售價 US $0.99，非常適合尋求簡單有效方法來管理注意力與情緒的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>智能引導與隱私保護</h2>\n<p>用戶可從「專注」、「修復」或「情緒調節」三種狀態中選取，透過「隨機推薦」或瀏覽超過 30 種工具來尋找解決方案。每個工具均附有簡明步驟指引及內建計時器，讓你能無需過度思考即可立即開始。此外，應用支援創建個人化頭像並收集徽章以記錄進度，所有數據僅存於本地裝置，無帳號註冊且無追蹤，確保絕對的隱私安全。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ADHD Nook</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T19:58:18.128023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}